  "details": "Description\n\nHUD elements don't get hidden when I set the hide HUD elements setting to on, such as the microphone icon.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nDisable HUD elements, and try speaking, or toggle mute. Otherwise, enable face mirror, or have the guide buttons enabled. A workaround I found for this before the most recent update is to set the HUD elements opacity to 0, but now the mirror and microphone icons show anyway.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-10_09-24-09.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_8fb22e4c-6380-4b0e-b0a5-5bd51cbedeb0/1/file)",
